"plural+es" adds one rule before the plural-only stemmer: strip "es" after ss, x, ch, sh or z (esStem in
tokenizer-probe-2.go.txt). It is not the shipped rule set: the shipped tokenizer has no z case and also strips a final
"e" after ss, x, ch or sh, so "cache" folds to "cach" there and not here. The scorecard measures the shipped rules.
